      "text": "The item is at both sites on the Sites tab of Item (tcibd0501m100), with the receiving site's Default Supply Source set to Distribution. The receiving site has a planning cluster row for the item, made from the item's Clusters tab, with Ordering Site the receiving site in Items - Planning (cprpd1100m000), Planning ➔ Master Data ➔ Items ➔ Items - Planning. The sites themselves are made as in Create a site."
